WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.470
- Hi, I'm Monica, the beauty expert.

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:04.960
Hi, I'm Ashley, the coordination maven.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.630
[Monica] And today we're
gonna help one woman

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.474
avoid a quarter-life crisis.

00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:11.250
(upbeat music)

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.320
Naomi, tell us about
your quarter-life crisis.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.360
I am going to be a bridesmaid

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.900
in my best friend's wedding.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.060
I have to find my bridesmaid's dress,

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.350
and then I have to get
ready to go to New York.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.060
And then, I'm just a little nervous

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.830
'cause going to New York and being in

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:30.100
a very fancy wedding with
people I've never met before,

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.560
and they're like
beautiful, gorgeous women,

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:36.800
so I just feel very out of my element.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.830
To start off, like,
before we even get into

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.150
all the stuff you have to do,

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:41.720
those beautiful, gorgeous women -

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.900
you are one of them also.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.950
We'll get to give you tips and tools

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:47.930
to help you be in touch with that truth

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:49.230
and not forget it when you're there.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.068
Thanks, guys. I'm excited!

00:00:51.068 --> 00:00:52.683
Oh, you're so welcome.

00:00:52.683 --> 00:00:53.516
Hi!

00:00:55.766 --> 00:00:57.950
Okay, so here is where I get ready.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.250
The one thing I'm really worried about

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:02.930
is I'm going straight from
the plane, my red eye,

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.110
straight to the all-day
bachelorette party.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:05.943
Oh yes!

00:01:05.943 --> 00:01:07.900
To start, for the skin-care stuff,

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.430
I think to make your
routine fast and easier,

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:13.310
I'm gonna recommend the Olay Total Effects

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:14.860
7 in One moisturizer.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:16.300
It's gonna give you all the benefits

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:17.480
of all the stuff you have,

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.650
and it'll be one bottle,
so it's travel-friendly.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:21.450
It's gonna give you the
same brightening effect,

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:23.210
combined with all the other stuff.

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:26.260
I have to have two major outfits:

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:29.100
the first one being
the bachelorette party,

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.440
which I hope you guys can help me

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:32.720
maybe find something in my closet

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:34.450
that I can wear;

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:37.590
and then the second one
being my bridesmaid's dress.

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.760
I'm thinking maybe this dress,

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:41.830
you can wear it in the day

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:44.030
and then just restyle it for night.

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:46.203
Maybe this for the night?

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:49.160
I mean, you can keep the
same dress on all day

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.350
but kinda revamp it.

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:51.425
I like it!

00:01:51.425 --> 00:01:52.258
[Monica] Are you feeling this?

00:01:52.258 --> 00:01:53.091
I am!

00:01:53.091 --> 00:01:55.320
So, when I wake up, I turn off my alarm,

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.460
and then that just leads me

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:58.570
to checking all my social medias

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:00.294
and watching all these videos,

00:02:00.294 --> 00:02:03.950
and then I start comparing
myself to other people,

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:05.997
and what they're doing,
and what I'm not doing,

00:02:05.997 --> 00:02:09.950
and it just doesn't really set me up

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:11.370
to start my day positively.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:12.980
One thing I wanna see happen is

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:16.320
we get you an alarm clock that

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.770
you can use instead,

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.950
and I want to help you
create a morning routine

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.563
that is gonna rock your world.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.800
So, it's a couple of days in,

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.980
and I've been implementing
some of the things

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:31.980
that Ashley told me to do,

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.590
especially with social media.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:36.170
She gave me this, which was so sweet.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.520
This is where my phone goes at night

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:41.410
so I don't look at it,
especially when I wake up.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.640
And then I feel like my
confidence is growing,

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.970
which makes me really
excited for the wedding,

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:46.940
'cause I feel like I'm gonna be

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:48.970
the best version of
myself when I get there.

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:50.600
So, I just cleansed my face,

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:53.820
so now it's time to try the Olay 7 in One

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.550
that Monica recommended.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:56.540
Here she is.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.920
Already it feels so good going on.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:02.490
And then the bonus is it's travel size,

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.760
so I can just bring it
on the plane with me.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:07.203
I was doing really well with, like,

00:03:09.559 --> 00:03:11.983
not looking at my social
media in the morning,

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:17.030
and then it was like the weekend,

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.770
and I was like, "It's Saturday.

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:21.890
I don't have anything to do today.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:23.110
I'll look at my phone in the morning,

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:23.943
and it'll be fine."

00:03:23.943 --> 00:03:25.150
Like, you know when you do it

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.470
it's not gonna make you feel good.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.150
It's not gonna make you feel like

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:29.290
the person you wanna be.

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:33.790
So, right now, I just
feel, like, disappointed.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.010
So, tell us how it's been going

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:39.500
these last couple of weeks.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:42.850
I think I've had some
really good things happen,

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:45.460
like with taking care of my skin

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:48.200
and using that moisturizer you suggested.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:51.150
And then the other thing that
I checked off my list was

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:54.530
I officially nailed down a
bachelorette party outfit.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:56.070
[Both] Yay!

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:58.840
But I am not doing very well with

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.640
the other two things
that you guys gave me.

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:04.070
I'm struggling with social media again,

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:05.800
and then because I've been looking,

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.250
I just can't get myself

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:12.160
to look up options for
my bridesmaid's dress.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.530
Finding this dress might be

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:15.220
more fun than you think.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:17.880
I just feel like sometimes
I have a block in my head

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.760
from going shopping with my mom

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.170
and never being able to, like,

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:24.230
find something that fits, you know?

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:29.040
So, I think that's a real
struggle that I'm dealing with.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.260
Here, give me, give me your hand.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:33.310
You're gonna find that dress,

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.100
and you're gonna feel so good.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:35.933
You know what you're like,

00:04:35.933 --> 00:04:37.200
and you're gonna find a dress.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.745
Okay, thank you, guys.

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:39.760
(cheerful music)

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:43.070
Okay, so I have gotten
my dresses in the mail,

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:45.800
and I'm trying them on.
And this is the first one,

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.983
and I don't hate it!

00:04:50.081 --> 00:04:52.187
I don't think this is the one.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:56.653
I am having so much fun
trying all these dresses on.

00:04:57.850 --> 00:04:58.840
All right, enough waiting.
Let's call her in.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.430
Yeah, you're right, I can't wait anymore.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:01.420
[Both] Naomi!

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.253
Hi!

00:05:03.435 --> 00:05:04.906
[Ashley] You look amazing!

00:05:04.906 --> 00:05:05.870
(shrieking)

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:08.190
You clearly killed this look.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:09.490
This is a really good fit.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.230
So, since you surprised us by

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.250
finally showing us this dress,

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.650
we have a surprise for you!

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.294
We have the bride, Melissa, on the line!

00:05:18.294 --> 00:05:19.127
Oh, hi!

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:24.240
I think you look absolutely
stunning in this dress.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:26.010
What I love about it is I feel like

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.520
it combines me and you into a dress,

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:30.100
'cause it's got the poof that's so you,

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.440
and then the lace is so me, and it just,

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.260
it's us together in a dress!

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:35.200
I love it!

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.990
I'm so glad I'm your friend

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:38.540
and that I get to be with you!

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:39.760
You're getting married!

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:43.080
Ladies, I just wanted to say,

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.310
thank you so much for
everything you've done for me.

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:48.430
Now I feel like a more
confident, beautiful,

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.540
radiant woman because of you two,

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.573
so thank you so much, ladies!

00:05:53.573 --> 00:05:54.550
[Monica] You're so welcome!

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:55.967
Send us pictures!

